  ⚠ unicorn(no-array-concat-in-loop): Do not use `Array#concat()` to accumulate an array in a loop.
   ╭─[no_array_concat_in_loop.js:4:33]
 3 │             for (const chunk of chunks) {
 4 │                 result = result.concat(chunk);
   ·                                 ──────
 5 │             }
   ╰────
  help: Use `Array#push()` or collect the chunks and flatten them after the loop.
